{"data":{"degrees":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Licenciatura en Sistemas de Información","school":"Universidade de São Paulo (USP)","date":"2026","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/04e32/each-usp.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/d1021/each-usp.jpg 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/57bda/each-usp.jpg 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/04e32/each-usp.jpg 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/41a6e/each-usp.jpg 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/87ded/each-usp.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/03f27/each-usp.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/0388b/each-usp.avif 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/5cdf9/each-usp.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/5e303/each-usp.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/192d2/each-usp.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/7498b/each-usp.webp 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/3ef79/each-usp.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":464}}},"end":"2029","tech":["Estructuras de Datos & Algoritmos","Sistemas de Bases de Datos","Ingeniería de Software","Redes de Computadoras","Sistemas Operativos","Desarrollo Web"],"external":"https://www5.usp.br/","lang":"es"},"html":"<p>Programa de grado integral centrado en el diseño, desarrollo y gestión de sistemas de información en contextos organizacionales. Combina bases técnicas sólidas con aplicaciones prácticas en entornos reales.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fundamentos de Computación:</strong> Formación sólida en <strong>Estructuras de Datos, Algoritmos y Matemática Discreta</strong>, que permite la resolución eficiente de problemas y el diseño de sistemas robustos.</li>\n<li><strong>Desarrollo de Software:</strong> Experiencia práctica con <strong>principios de Ingeniería de Software</strong>, incluyendo arquitectura de sistemas, control de versiones y metodologías ágiles.</li>\n<li><strong>Gestión de Datos:</strong> Estudio profundo de <strong>Sistemas de Bases de Datos</strong>, abarcando modelado relacional, SQL e integridad de datos.</li>\n<li><strong>Sistemas &#x26; Infraestructura:</strong> Comprensión de <strong>Sistemas Operativos y Redes de Computadoras</strong>, esenciales para aplicaciones escalables y confiables.</li>\n<li><strong>Tecnología Aplicada:</strong> Enfoque en <strong>Desarrollo Web y Sistemas de Información</strong>, conectando las necesidades del negocio con soluciones tecnológicas.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Bachelor's Degree in Information Systems","school":"Universidade de São Paulo (USP)","date":"2026","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/04e32/each-usp.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/d1021/each-usp.jpg 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/57bda/each-usp.jpg 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/04e32/each-usp.jpg 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/41a6e/each-usp.jpg 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/87ded/each-usp.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/03f27/each-usp.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/0388b/each-usp.avif 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/5cdf9/each-usp.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/5e303/each-usp.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/192d2/each-usp.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/7498b/each-usp.webp 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/3ef79/each-usp.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":464}}},"end":"2029","tech":["Data Structures & Algorithms","Database Systems","Software Engineering","Computer Networks","Operating Systems","Web Development"],"external":"https://www5.usp.br/","lang":null},"html":"<p>Comprehensive undergraduate program focused on the design, development, and management of information systems within organizational contexts. Combines strong technical foundations with practical applications in real-world environments.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core Computing Foundations:</strong> Solid training in <strong>Data Structures, Algorithms, and Discrete Mathematics</strong>, enabling efficient problem-solving and system design.</li>\n<li><strong>Software Development:</strong> Hands-on experience with <strong>Software Engineering principles</strong>, including system architecture, version control, and agile methodologies.</li>\n<li><strong>Data Management:</strong> In-depth study of <strong>Database Systems</strong>, covering relational modeling, SQL, and data integrity.</li>\n<li><strong>Systems &#x26; Infrastructure:</strong> Understanding of <strong>Operating Systems and Computer Networks</strong>, providing the backbone for scalable and reliable applications.</li>\n<li><strong>Applied Technology:</strong> Focus on <strong>Web Development and Information Systems</strong>, bridging business needs with technological solutions.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"信息系统学士学位","school":"Universidade de São Paulo (USP)","date":"2026","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/04e32/each-usp.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/d1021/each-usp.jpg 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/57bda/each-usp.jpg 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/04e32/each-usp.jpg 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/41a6e/each-usp.jpg 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/87ded/each-usp.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/03f27/each-usp.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/0388b/each-usp.avif 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/5cdf9/each-usp.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/5e303/each-usp.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/192d2/each-usp.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/7498b/each-usp.webp 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/3ef79/each-usp.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":464}}},"end":"2029","tech":["数据结构与算法","数据库系统","软件工程","计算机网络","操作系统","Web 开发"],"external":"https://www5.usp.br/","lang":"zh"},"html":"<p>一项全面的本科课程,专注于信息系统在组织环境中的设计、开发与管理。将扎实的技术基础与真实场景中的实践应用相结合。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>计算机核心基础:</strong> 扎实掌握<strong>数据结构、算法与离散数学</strong>,从而高效地解决问题并设计系统。</li>\n<li><strong>软件开发:</strong> 实践<strong>软件工程原则</strong>,包括系统架构、版本控制与敏捷方法论。</li>\n<li><strong>数据管理:</strong> 深入学习<strong>数据库系统</strong>,涵盖关系建模、SQL 与数据完整性。</li>\n<li><strong>系统与基础设施:</strong> 理解<strong>操作系统与计算机网络</strong>,为可扩展、可靠的应用程序提供支撑。</li>\n<li><strong>应用技术:</strong> 专注于 <strong>Web 开发与信息系统</strong>,将业务需求与技术解决方案相连接。</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Bacharelado em Sistemas de Informação","school":"Universidade de São Paulo (USP)","date":"2026","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/04e32/each-usp.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/d1021/each-usp.jpg 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/57bda/each-usp.jpg 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/04e32/each-usp.jpg 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/41a6e/each-usp.jpg 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/87ded/each-usp.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/03f27/each-usp.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/0388b/each-usp.avif 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/5cdf9/each-usp.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/5e303/each-usp.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/192d2/each-usp.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/7498b/each-usp.webp 700w,\n/Portfolio/static/b93105f93d6432be834d7cd371e65de8/3ef79/each-usp.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":464}}},"end":"2029","tech":["Estruturas de Dados & Algoritmos","Sistemas de Banco de Dados","Engenharia de Software","Redes de Computadores","Sistemas Operacionais","Desenvolvimento Web"],"external":"https://www5.usp.br/","lang":"pt"},"html":"<p>Graduação abrangente focada no projeto, desenvolvimento e gestão de sistemas de informação em contextos organizacionais. Combina fundamentos técnicos sólidos com aplicação prática em cenários reais.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fundamentos da Computação:</strong> Formação sólida em <strong>Estruturas de Dados, Algoritmos e Matemática Discreta</strong>, permitindo a resolução eficiente de problemas e o desenvolvimento de sistemas robustos.</li>\n<li><strong>Desenvolvimento de Software:</strong> Experiência prática com <strong>princípios de Engenharia de Software</strong>, incluindo arquitetura de sistemas, controle de versão e metodologias ágeis.</li>\n<li><strong>Gestão de Dados:</strong> Estudo aprofundado de <strong>Sistemas de Banco de Dados</strong>, abrangendo modelagem relacional, SQL e integridade de dados.</li>\n<li><strong>Sistemas &#x26; Infraestrutura:</strong> Compreensão de <strong>Sistemas Operacionais e Redes de Computadores</strong>, essenciais para aplicações escaláveis e confiáveis.</li>\n<li><strong>Tecnologia Aplicada:</strong> Foco em <strong>Desenvolvimento Web e Sistemas de Informação</strong>, conectando necessidades de negócio a soluções tecnológicas.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Bachillerato Técnico en Desarrollo de Sistemas","school":"ETEC Taboão da Serra","date":"2023","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/d6b18/etects.jpg 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/fac6d/etects.jpg 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/1934d/etects.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/4564e/etects.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/62eae/etects.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/745fa/etects.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/37527/etects.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ea0a8/etects.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":399}}},"end":"2026","tech":["Lógica & Algoritmos","HTML5/CSS3/JS","Java/PHP (Backend)","SQL (MySQL/SQL Server)","Mobile (Android/Kotlin)","Análisis de Sistemas (UML)","Pruebas de Software"],"external":"https://www.etec.sp.gov.br","lang":"es"},"html":"<p>Programa técnico integral de 3 módulos centrado en el análisis, diseño, desarrollo, prueba e implementación de sistemas computacionales. El plan de estudios enfatiza el desarrollo multiplataforma y las prácticas estándar de la industria.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Currículo Central:</strong> Dominio de <strong>Lógica de Programación &#x26; Algoritmos</strong>, modelado de bases de datos relacionales (MER/DER) e implementación SQL, y Programación Orientada a Objetos (POO).</li>\n<li><strong>Desarrollo Web &#x26; Mobile:</strong> Construcción de aplicaciones web responsivas usando HTML, CSS, JavaScript y PHP/Java, junto con desarrollo móvil nativo para Android.</li>\n<li><strong>Ingeniería &#x26; Calidad:</strong> Aprendizaje de <strong>Análisis de Sistemas</strong> (Requisitos, Diagramación UML), Diseño de Interfaz (principios UI/UX) y metodologías de Pruebas de Software.</li>\n<li><strong>Proyecto Final (TCC):</strong> Desarrollo y documentación de una solución de software completa para un problema real, gestionando el ciclo de vida del proyecto desde la concepción hasta la implementación.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Technical High School in Software Development","school":"ETEC Taboão da Serra","date":"2023","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/d6b18/etects.jpg 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/fac6d/etects.jpg 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/1934d/etects.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/4564e/etects.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/62eae/etects.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/745fa/etects.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/37527/etects.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ea0a8/etects.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":399}}},"end":"2026","tech":["Logic & Algorithms","HTML5/CSS3/JS","Java/PHP (Backend)","SQL (MySQL/SQL Server)","Mobile (Android/Kotlin)","Systems Analysis (UML)","Software Testing"],"external":"https://www.etec.sp.gov.br","lang":null},"html":"<p>Comprehensive 3-module technical program focused on the analysis, design, development, testing, and deployment of computational systems. The curriculum emphasizes multi-platform development and industry-standard practices.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core Curriculum:</strong> Mastered <strong>Algorithms &#x26; Programming Logic</strong>, relational database modeling (MER/DER) and SQL implementation, and Object-Oriented Programming (OOP).</li>\n<li><strong>Web &#x26; Mobile Development:</strong> Built responsive web applications using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and PHP/Java, alongside native mobile Android development.</li>\n<li><strong>Engineering &#x26; Quality:</strong> Learned <strong>Systems Analysis</strong> (Requirements, UML Diagramming), Interface Design (UI/UX principles), and Software Testing methodologies.</li>\n<li><strong>Capstone Project (TCC):</strong> Developed and documented a complete software solution for a real-world problem, managing the project lifecycle from conception to deployment.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"软件开发技术高中","school":"ETEC Taboão da Serra","date":"2023","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/d6b18/etects.jpg 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/fac6d/etects.jpg 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/1934d/etects.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/4564e/etects.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/62eae/etects.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/745fa/etects.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/37527/etects.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ea0a8/etects.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":399}}},"end":"2026","tech":["逻辑与算法","HTML5/CSS3/JS","Java/PHP(后端)","SQL(MySQL/SQL Server)","移动端(Android/Kotlin)","系统分析(UML)","软件测试"],"external":"https://www.etec.sp.gov.br","lang":"zh"},"html":"<p>一项全面的三阶段技术课程,专注于计算系统的分析、设计、开发、测试与部署。课程强调跨平台开发与行业标准实践。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>核心课程:</strong> 掌握<strong>算法与编程逻辑</strong>、关系型数据库建模(MER/DER)与 SQL 实现,以及面向对象编程(OOP)。</li>\n<li><strong>Web 与移动开发:</strong> 使用 HTML、CSS、JavaScript 与 PHP/Java 构建响应式 Web 应用,同时进行原生 Android 移动开发。</li>\n<li><strong>工程与质量:</strong> 学习<strong>系统分析</strong>(需求分析、UML 建模)、界面设计(UI/UX 原则)与软件测试方法论。</li>\n<li><strong>毕业设计(TCC):</strong> 为真实问题开发并撰写完整的软件解决方案文档,管理从构思到部署的整个项目生命周期。</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Ensino Médio Técnico em Desenvolvimento de Sistemas","school":"ETEC Taboão da Serra","date":"2023","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/d6b18/etects.jpg 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/fac6d/etects.jpg 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ce8bb/etects.jpg 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/1934d/etects.avif 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/4564e/etects.avif 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/62eae/etects.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/745fa/etects.webp 175w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/37527/etects.webp 350w,\n/Portfolio/static/ef13ff9cdf5c1c9a5c6fbae97717e91c/ea0a8/etects.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":399}}},"end":"2026","tech":["Lógica & Algoritmos","HTML5/CSS3/JS","Java/PHP (Backend)","SQL (MySQL/SQL Server)","Mobile (Android/Kotlin)","Análise de Sistemas (UML)","Teste de Software"],"external":"https://www.etec.sp.gov.br","lang":"pt"},"html":"<p>Programa técnico abrangente de 3 módulos focado na análise, design, desenvolvimento, teste e implantação de sistemas computacionais. O currículo enfatiza o desenvolvimento multiplataforma e práticas padrão da indústria.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Currículo Central:</strong> Domínio de <strong>Lógica de Programação &#x26; Algoritmos</strong>, modelagem de banco de dados relacional (MER/DER), implementação SQL e Programação Orientada a Objetos (POO).</li>\n<li><strong>Desenvolvimento Web &#x26; Mobile:</strong> Construção de aplicações web responsivas usando HTML, CSS, JavaScript e PHP/Java, juntamente com desenvolvimento mobile nativo para Android.</li>\n<li><strong>Engenharia &#x26; Qualidade:</strong> Aprendizado de <strong>Análise de Sistemas</strong> (Requisitos, Diagramação UML), Design de Interface (princípios UI/UX) e metodologias de Teste de Software.</li>\n<li><strong>Projeto de Conclusão (TCC):</strong> Desenvolvimento e documentação de uma solução de software completa para um problema real, gerenciando o ciclo de vida do projeto desde a concepção até a implantação.</li>\n</ul>"}}]}}}